  "info": {
    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_SIM Swap Management API",
    "description": "The SIM Swap Management API facilitates the efficient handling of SIM card swaps within the telecommunications domain. This API allows authorized users to submit requests for switching SIM cards associated with customer accounts. Typical consumers include customer service representatives and automated systems managing customer profiles. The API ensures seamless transitions for customers needing to switch SIM cards due to various reasons, enhancing customer experience and operational efficiency.",
